{title: Mera Inteqam Dekhegi}
{artist: Anand Raj Anand Krishna}
{key: Fm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Fm]Jo dil mein bhara tune
[A#m]Dekhegi [D#]uss [Cm]zeher ko
[Fm]Bhugtegi mere gham ko
[A#m]Meri [D#]aah ke [Cm]kahar ko
[D#]Apni khudgarzi [Cm]ka ab
[C#]anzaam [Fm]dekhegi
[Fm]Thukra ke [C#]mera pyaar
[D#]Mera intkam [Fm]dekhegi ..x2
[Fm]Chahat ka [A#m]sila zaalim
[D#]Matlab hi [G#]diya tune
[Fm]Majboor na [A#m]thi phir bhi
[D#]Dhokha [Cm]kiya tune
[D#]Nafrat ko [Cm]meri ab tu
[C#]Subah [Fm]shaam dekhegi
[Fm]Thukra ke [C#]mera pyaar
[D#]Mera intkam [Fm]dekhegi ..x2
[Fm]Tune har [A#m]sitam jo mujhpe
[D#]Kuch soch [G#]ke kiya hai
[Fm]Kudrat ne [A#m]sila uska
[D#]Aakhir tujhe [Cm]diya hai
[D#]Duniya [Cm]shikast teri
[C#]sar-e-aam [Fm]dekhegi
[Fm]Thukra ke [C#]mera pyaar
[D#]Mera intkam [Fm]dekhegi ..x2
